      {
        "case_id": "F04",
        "answer": "During a billing\u2011profile migration, auto\u2011pay is automatically paused. It remains on hold for the entire migration window and will not restart until the account owner confirms the new default payment method after migration completes. This pause prevents any charge attempts against a payment method that may have failed re\u2011verification, and once the owner confirms the new method, auto\u2011pay resumes and any deferred invoices are paid.\u202f[HC-BILL-001--recurring-billing-and-auto-pay-impact--prose-001]\u202f[HC-BILL-003--auto-pay-behavior-after-migration--prose-001]",
